<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n24456" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δημο-τελής</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ές</span>,
			(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τέλος</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>at the public cost,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θυσίη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					6.57
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Lg.</u>
				935b
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				6.53.6
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>CIG</u>
				3493.7
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Thyatira</span>); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἑορτή</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Th.
					2.15
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>OGI</u>
				56.41
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii B. C.)</span>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πανάγυριν
				δαμοτέλην</span> (sic) <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				12(2).645.44
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Nesus</span>); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δ.
				ἱερὰ τελεῖν</span> Orac. ap. <i><span class="en">
				D.
				21.53
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>with public authority, sovereign,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκκλησία</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>AJA</u>
					18.324
				</span></i>
			 (<span class="entity">Sardis</span>). Adv.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-λῶς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Suid.
				</span></i>
			
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> epith. of Demeter, <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				12(7).4.5
			</span></i>(<span class="entity">Amorgos</span>).</div>
